  "description": "Ref: previous Lawful Development Certificate Council Ref 231375CPL  PP-12069642. 1 August 2023.\n\nThis application refers partly to the ground floor side and rear extension.  [Roof conversion is not included and has been removed].  There is a minor increase of the ground floor rear extension to overlap the main house by 150mm [to enable structural support to the new conservatory roof and the new sliding doors opening out onto the verandah].\n\nThe focus of this application is the rear verandah lean-to roof and buildup of paved area, raised by c. 0.5M to the house floor level and horizontal extension towards the rear of the site by 2m.  The levels and extension are equal to the neighbouring houses on both sides at No.36 and 40.   \n\nInternally the Garage is now proposed for conversion to an extra bedroom with ensuite shower rather than the loft conversion previously planned. This is incorporated into the application.\n",
